                  "id": "Q0zcSS",
                  "name": "ScoreInput",
                  "context": "Score entry for one risk in one quarter (Lini 1 or one Lini 3 directorate). Numeric 0,0–4,0, one decimal, comma separator; accepts '3.2' and normalises to '3,2'. PredicateBadge in PredicateSlot updates live from active score bands (swap the ref). Out of range: error 'Skor 0,0–4,0'; blur does not save invalid value. Locked: after finalise once comparison opens (INV-18) — read-only, lock icon. Blind rule VIS-1: only own score visible. Autosaves draft.",
                  "reusable": true,
                  "metadata": {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "aria": {
                      "role": "spinbutton",
                      "label": "Skor"
