                  "name": "MatrixCell",
                  "context": "Risk × quarter cell (FR-RWY-002) and Lembar Mutu cell (FR-RWY-001). One line per assessor: label (L1 / KEP / PAI), score (mono), predicate mini-chip (T/C/K letter + colour), result ✓/✕ per Lini 3 line. States by override: open (default), partial (a Lini 3 line 'Menunggu'), 'Belum relevan' / 'Tidak dinilai Lini 1' on L1 line, whole-cell 'Menunggu' (comparison not open, VIS-1) via WaitingText, '—' (risk not active that quarter) via DashText. Click opens the cell detail slide-over (FR-RWY-003); aria-label spells predicates in full.",
                  "reusable": true,
                  "metadata": {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "aria": {
                      "role": "button"
