                          "type": "note",
                          "id": "SjBID",
                          "name": "FlowContext",
                          "width": 420,
                          "height": 150,
                          "content": "FLOW CONTEXT\nSebelum: /login default → klik \"Masuk dengan akun lokal\".\nSesudah: sukses → URL semula atau \"/\"; must_change_password → /ganti-kata-sandi (mode wajib)."
